          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: Over several nights around December 23, 1992, a witness observed from his home with his wife several very bright points with changing colors. During one observation, he noted that sudden changes in position were observed. The investigation will show that it was likely a confusion with identified stars such as Aldébaran and Gamma. The reported sudden changes in position could not be confirmed.",
